    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gutfarm! The soil and climate here are perfect for growing crops, but every nightfall, monsters will surge in like a tidal wave...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plowing, sowing, watering... Dozens of crops await your discovery, each with a wildly imaginative mutated variety that brings unexpected surprises\u2014or shocks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/e60acfbae44dd6b185c7c250a6d1917a.avif?t=1754823741\" width=694 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters are swarming in like tides\u2014defend yourself with your plants! How will you combine different types of plant turrets? Will you place traps and fences to alter the monsters' path? Will you go for a hands-on parkour style, or a safe and passive approach? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/13d11c04146d38ddc2336a1743e4b49a.avif?t=1754823741\" width=828 height=460 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to boost your survival skills! Gather resources, craft tools, and always make sure your backpack is stocked with enough food. Use relics to upgrade both your plants and yourself\u2014only then can you make it through the perils of this treacherous island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/1328fe2268e721fa12692dd48c5ea737.avif?t=1754823741\" width=892 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/830ad881188486cbd2c6fbcacb881072.avif?t=1754823741\" width=948 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/ceba42b0647ccd2716e24169f5cd82ad.avif?t=1754823741\" width=944 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gutfarm! The soil and climate here are perfect for growing crops, but every nightfall, monsters will surge in like a tidal wave...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plowing, sowing, watering... Dozens of crops await your discovery, each with a wildly imaginative mutated variety that brings unexpected surprises\u2014or shocks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/e60acfbae44dd6b185c7c250a6d1917a.avif?t=1754823741\" width=694 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters are swarming in like tides\u2014defend yourself with your plants! How will you combine different types of plant turrets? Will you place traps and fences to alter the monsters' path? Will you go for a hands-on parkour style, or a safe and passive approach? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/13d11c04146d38ddc2336a1743e4b49a.avif?t=1754823741\" width=828 height=460 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to boost your survival skills! Gather resources, craft tools, and always make sure your backpack is stocked with enough food. Use relics to upgrade both your plants and yourself\u2014only then can you make it through the perils of this treacherous island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/1328fe2268e721fa12692dd48c5ea737.avif?t=1754823741\" width=892 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/830ad881188486cbd2c6fbcacb881072.avif?t=1754823741\" width=948 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678130/extras/ceba42b0647ccd2716e24169f5cd82ad.avif?t=1754823741\" width=944 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Gutfarm is a top-down 2D pixel art game that blends farming, tower defense, and survival elements. On this alien island, you will expand and grow your farm by planting crops, unlocking genetically mutated varieties, defending against waves of monster attacks, collecting relics, and more!",
